{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedTraceResidueSplit","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedTraceResidueSplit","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.ConfinementLevel","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Field.Basic"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.strutinsky_analogue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.strutinsky_analogue","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GradedTraceResidueSplit.lean#L78-L87","doc":"The graded-trace residue split is the algebraic shadow of\nStrutinsky's `E = Ẽ + δE_shell`.\n\nRef: [leitner2026] §Nuclear Binding and Beta Stability. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.level_zero_pure_descended","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.level_zero_pure_descended","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GradedTraceResidueSplit.lean#L68-L76","doc":"Level-0 case: when oscillating residue vanishes, total = smooth.\nThis recovers the pure-descended regime.\n\nRef: [leitner2026] `prop:categorical-mass-markov`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedTraceResidueSplit.oscillating_is_residue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedTraceResidueSplit.oscillating_is_residue","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GradedTraceResidueSplit.lean#L65-L65","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedTraceResidueSplit.smooth_is_graded","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedTraceResidueSplit.smooth_is_graded","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https: