daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GradedTraceResidueSplit.lean#L42-L44","doc":"The total residue contribution.  Concrete model: returns 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.GradedTraceResidueSplit.gradedTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.GradedTraceResidueSplit.gradedTrace","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GradedTraceResidueSplit.lean#L37-L40","doc":"The Markov trace on the associated graded algebra.  Concrete\nmodel: returns 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.symbolMap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.symbolMap","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/GradedTraceResidueSplit.lean#L33-L35","doc":"The symbol map `σ: J^ℓ → J^ℓ/J^{ℓ+1}`.  Concrete model: identity. ","signatureChunk":0}]}